    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/20b928d166ad729dff4628ee7aff9f38.avif?t=1751648808\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo-campaign contains</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 story levels featuring diverse combat environments, from dense forests to urban battlegrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 secret levels with experimental gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation Editor and\u00a0Community Workshop with user created maps (unlocks during the story).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game files and emails dynamically react to the outcome of your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love for tactical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore real-time tactics focused on realistic simulation of modern firefights guided from the drone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the lead of six brave soldiers, split into four squads: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie and Echo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestrate actions of your troops in real-time from the drone flying above the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppress your enemies and storm their positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of equipment, such as rocket launchers, bomb drones, and artillery barrages, to break through especially tough defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid casualties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Level Editor and Community Workshop to create your own combat experiences and share them with other drone operators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Note! This is not a conventional RTS, but hardcore RTT. Never maneuver without suppressive fire \u2014 it will never end well.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=650 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your country is invaded. Military organization VEIL invites you to join as a tester for their new drone-based warfare communication system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can impact the situation on the battlefield directly from your home PC. Connect to the variety of drones and provide guidance to the troops in the field.<br> <br>Your squad\u00a0is equipped with the new generation of combat visors and will be able to receive your direct guidance from the sky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They put trust in you and will shoot or move wherever you tell them, but be careful and weigh every step, because the price of your mistake is someone\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game operation system called VEIL OS to connect to your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage emails, install and maintain OS software to make sure you're using up-to-date technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness eerie events and try to uncover the truth in the conspiracy surrounding your employer,  VEIL CORP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use help from the outside to affect the fabric of in-game reality and change the outcome of existing events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful whom you trust.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/a366400e5c88d94201466d33a26f61e5.avif?t=1751648808\" width=680 height=382 /></span>Use remote environment called VEIL OS to connect to your missions and to navigate through conspiracies in reality-bending meta-gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the situation is dire, use bomb drone to clean your way. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/6b28ded2c3937e329933582f05c4f807.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=778 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/6b28ded2c3937e329933582f05c4f807.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/6b28ded2c3937e329933582f05c4f807.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rocket launchers, to find the new ways of resolving tactical puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/712ce9fefe1dcaa3216d8ef4abb9f7e4.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=626 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/712ce9fefe1dcaa3216d8ef4abb9f7e4.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/712ce9fefe1dcaa3216d8ef4abb9f7e4.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your own combat experiences and share them with other drone operators in Community Workshop. (You can unlock it during the story).<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Witness with your own eyes why modern war is not a Hollywood movie.</p>",
