core RTT. Never maneuver without suppressive fire \u2014 it will never end well.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=650 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/10c5fd4d1f91ec7e13d708b464f12130.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your country is invaded. Military organization VEIL invites you to join as a tester for their new drone-based warfare communication system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can impact the situation on the battlefield directly from your home PC. Connect to the variety of drones and provide guidance to the troops in the field.<br> <br>Your squad\u00a0is equipped with the new generation of combat visors and will be able to receive your direct guidance from the sky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They put trust in you and will shoot or move wherever you tell them, but be careful and weigh every step, because the price of your mistake is someone\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game operation system called VEIL OS to connect to your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage emails, install and maintain OS software to make sure you're using up-to-date technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness eerie events and try to uncover the truth in the conspiracy surrounding your employer,  VEIL CORP.</p></li><li><p class=\"