"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/712ce9fefe1dcaa3216d8ef4abb9f7e4.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your own combat experiences and share them with other drone operators in Community Workshop. (You can unlock it during the story).<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.poster.avif?t=1751648808\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.webm?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730700/extras/abde42b474ada6d0bf48c1b13bf12515.mp4?t=1751648808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Witness with your own eyes why modern war is not a Hollywood movie.</p>",
